{
  "bodyHash": "bed081cceaf6ff01",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">理論上，此模組支援<strong>所有</strong>&nbsp;模組載入器！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">簡介</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">在 1.19 及更新版本的 Minecraft 中，如果沒有現存的存檔，點擊「單人遊戲」按鈕時，Minecraft 會<strong>自動開啟「建立新世界」畫面</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">如果載入了大量模組，上述過程可能會非常緩慢，導致誤觸此按鈕的玩家必須等待好幾秒。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">此模組讓 Minecraft 能夠<strong>即使在沒有現存取檔的情況下，仍顯示空的世界選擇清單畫面</strong>，就像 1.19 之前的版本一樣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">展示</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">當你在沒有任何存檔的情況下點擊「單人遊戲」時：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">未安裝此模組：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/743/151/2023-10-14_23.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"209\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">已載入此模組：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/743/152/2023-10-14_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>絕對可以</strong></span>將此模組加入你的模組整合包中；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本專案遵循&nbsp;<strong>Nova Relay License 1.0</strong>授權條款。</span></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
